{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"“双刃”费萨","text":"[show]太好了，非常感谢你们，契约者。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"“双刃”费萨","text":"[show]这些恐兽之前总在村子附近徘徊，自卫团被这些魔物搞得焦头烂额。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"“双刃”费萨","text":"[show]虽然可能还有漏网之鱼，但是我们的压力已经减轻了许多。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"“双刃”费萨","text":"[show]大家可以稍微放松一些了，而我也能尝试做一些厨子的工作了……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"“双刃”费萨","text":"[show]我们是不会忘记你们契约者的恩情的，再次感谢！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"script":"wt_c2_01_1","des":"盘踞在巴诺姆村旁的祸害"}